  "title": "The Korea Economic Daily discusses Burford's industry leadership",
  "summary": "The Korea Economic Daily writes about Burford's leadership in the legal finance industry and quotes Jonathan Molot, citing his comments in this year's shareholder letter: \"'Our asset modeling is based on a vast amount of proprietary data. This allows us to precisely measure the risk and potential returns of the litigation we invest in.' He added, 'We're not simply a lender; we're a technology-driven financial firm that quantitatively analyzes and prices legal risk.'\" Learn more.",
